—Cap. XII, 6,  <HI REND="ITALIC">portabat.</HI>  Lection.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">exportabat,</HI>  quae
lectio favet doctissimi Huetii interpretationi, qui verbum
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejbavstazen</FOREIGN>  hoc loco de furto interpretatur. Idem
vers. 8,  <HI REND="ITALIC">habebitis</HI>  in Lectionario, pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">habetis.</HI></P> <DIV2 SECOND=YES COM="0443"><HEAD COM="0443">IN ACTIBUS APOSTOLORUM.</HEAD> <P COM="0443">ACT. I, 2,  <HI REND="ITALIC">per Spiritum sanctum quos elegit, assumptus
