 <COL N="0444A"></COL> haec vers. 33,  <HI REND="ITALIC">omnis domus ejus.</HI>  Lection.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">omnes ejus,</HI> 
cum Graecis.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 SECOND=YES COM="0444"><HEAD COM="0444">IN EPISTOLIS PAULI.</HEAD> <P COM="0444">ROM. VIII, 3,  <HI REND="ITALIC">impossibile erat legi;</HI>  in Lection.  <HI REND="ITALIC">legis,</HI> 
ut in Graeco,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nomouð.</FOREIGN>  Et vers. 16,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ipse enim spiritus.</HI> 
