sum usque adhuc.</HI>  Deest in Lectionario et in
Graeco. Ibid., vers. 29,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Evangelii.</HI>  Deest in Lectionar.,
quanquam habetur in Graeco.</P> <P COM="0444">I COR. VII, 39,  <HI REND="ITALIC">liberata est.</HI>  Lection. addit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">a lege.</HI> 
—Cap. X, 17,  <HI REND="ITALIC">de uno pane participamus.</HI>  Lection.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">de
