 <HI REND="ITALIC">canet enim tuba.</HI>  Deest duobus in locis Lectionarii
 <HI REND="ITALIC">tuba.</HI>  Attamen Gregorius Turonensis episcopus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">tuba</HI> 
legit in Historiae lib. X cap. 13.</P> <P COM="0444">GALAT. V, 13,  <HI REND="ITALIC">caritatem spiritus;</HI>  in Lection. deest
