annis mille benedictio cerei paschalis
quae praeconium dicitur, 142, 241, 357.
Augustini Codex in papyro Aegyptiaca
seu charta scriptus, 184. Augustini loci
 <COL N="1126"></COL> insignes de cantu in Africa recepto,
388  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seqq.</HI>  Augustini locus de liturgia,
14, 15. Augustini pseudoepistola
ad Bibianum episcopum Santonensem,
458. Augustino an tribuendus sermo
